        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Custom 48 10SW-Ipe 1-1/2\" Diameter Ipe Wood Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis stunning 48\" custom door pull combines the warmth and beauty of dark Ipe wood with bold solid brass mounting brackets and end caps. Assembled in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for  high quality innovational door pull designs.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese Ipe wood handles are unstained in their natural dark color. Staining is not required. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ipe wood used is very dark. It is a hard, heavy wood with a very tight grain.  It is also  resistant to insects and  warping, even when exposed directly to harsh weather, making it the ideal choice for exterior doors. Great pull for commercial doors or residential doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 10W-Ipe Wood Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Ipe</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Cap Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length 48\" (22\" of Ipe in Center, 13\" End Caps</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Bracket and End Cap Finish Polished Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: Made-to-order  door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). \r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
